      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SO SI GOD (6) scratched from a winnable race on Wednesday to run here after a solid effort in this grade first-up as the race favourite. She'll be better for that effort and the bit lifter is a handy piece of gear going on. Drawn beautifully and can get back to winning ways. ESPRESSO TIME (1) made it back-to-back wins last time out, leading all of the way over this track and trip in an impressive win. He looks a nice horse on the rise and can continue to work through the grades. FRAPPUCCINO (7) was 1.3L off the winner in this company last start as a $26 chance when off a long break. Should be better for that effort and that form has already been franked. Can make an impression once again. BLUE CAN TALK (9) was too good fresh and can build on that effort.",
